    <mxCell id="an_bad_T162" value="&lt;div style='width:414px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#991B1B;'&gt;✕ APPENDING 90K RAW TOOL LOGS:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;Burying critical tenant constraints at token #52,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#FECACA;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="140" width="424" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="an_good_T162" value="&lt;div style='width:426px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#065F46;'&gt;✓ HEAD + TAIL EDGE PACKING:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;0x00k frozen KV prefix + URI pointers + 0x112k recency tail&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="462" y="140" width="434" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="mm_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;1M-TOKEN DUMPSTER MYTH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Attention Dilution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Treating Context Windows Like Infinite Append-Only Arrays&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Dumping raw 40k JSON tool outputs in the middle of history &lt;b&gt;breaks KV prefix caching and drops recall to 54%&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;-43% Middle Fact Recall&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="mm_tr" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#059669;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;SYSTEMS MEMORY PACKING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#D1FAE5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Primacy + Recency Edges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Lay Out Context Like a CPU Cache Line: Head + Tail Only&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Freeze byte-exact rules at &lt;b&gt;0x00k&lt;/b&gt;, offload raw blobs to URI pointers, and pack fresh facts + rubric at the &lt;b&gt;tail&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;96.8% Multi-Hop Accuracy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="mm_bot" value="&lt;div style='width:832px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;background:#F8FAFC;border:1.4px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:16px;padding:9px 13px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;MNEMONIC: M · E · M · M · A · P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Context Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Mount Static Prefix (0x00k) • Exclude Timestamps • Minimize Middle Noise • Move Blobs to URIs • Anchor Evidence Near Tail • Pin Final Rubric&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Think like a systems programmer: &lt;b&gt;context tokens are precious L1 SRAM&lt;/b&gt;, not cheap spinning disk.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="788" width="836" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c1_T162" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563EB;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;◆ 30s STAFF+ INTERVIEW PITCH&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&amp;ldquo;Transformer recall follows a &lt;b&gt;U-curve&lt;/b&gt;: we pin static rules at byte 0 for 90% KV cache savings, evict middle logs to URIs, and pack top-5 chunks at the tail.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c2_T162" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F766E;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;▲ DAY-1 GCP ⇄ OSS STACK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vertex Context Caching + ADK ArtifactService&lt;/b&gt; ⇄ vLLM Prefix Cache + MemGPT Tiering&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="323" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c3_T162" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#047857;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;★ L5 → L7 PROMO IMPACT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;Lifted 20-turn tool accuracy from &lt;b&gt;61% to 96.8%&lt;/b&gt; while cutting token spend &lt;b&gt;-79%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

